-- Build 193 - Serious Guided Diagnosis / Compact Bottom HUD / Automatic Result ZIP
--
-- User-facing goals:
--   • Run a detailed pre-diagnosis questionnaire before touching session routing.
--   • Keep questionnaire evidence separate from measured/detected evidence.
--   • Native GTA HUD at bottom-center during the deep diagnosis: time remaining,
--     Phase X/10, current sample/status, population/joins where useful.
--   • Post-run result popup with a ranked conclusion and "Most likely issue".
--   • Automatically create the normal Startup Support ZIP, then copy the validated ZIP
--     beside the Self Diagnosis report using the run ID as a dedicated package name.
--
-- Safety / integrity:
--   • No stat writes are introduced.
--   • Existing Build 188/187 strict non-interference remains authoritative.
--   • The live diagnostic uses native HUD drawing only; no active custom ImGui window is
--     opened during session transitions (the earlier crash-prone path stays disabled).
--   • Questionnaire answers are user-reported evidence, never mislabeled as detected.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

