        id="ACCOUNT_MISSION_HISTORY", category="Account Stats", title="Mission / Freemode Completion History Force-Edited",
        description="Marking missions or freemode activities complete without playing them can produce dense completion histories inconsistent with total playtime and other progression. Heist/business payout methods alone are intentionally not treated the same way.",
        fixes={"Identify directly force-completed mission/freemode flags and compare them with playtime/activity history.","Repair only synthetic completion history if necessary.","Keep legitimate heist/business earnings separate from this diagnosis."},
