        description="Property trophies, office/nightclub displays, and similar visual progression can be force-unlocked by stat tools. This supports an unlock-all history but is usually a secondary account-integrity signal.",
        fixes={"Review which trophy/display flags were force-enabled.","Prioritize stronger profile inconsistencies before cosmetic property displays.","If performing a full repair, normalize only known artificial flags."},
