        fixes={"Check the live tutorial and pending tutorial-session state reported by Startup.","If the tutorial was force-modified and live state remains abnormal, repair the onboarding flags using a known-good method.","Repeat the diagnostic only after the account loads into normal freemode without pending tutorial transitions."},
