        fixes={"Use this as context: compare the template similarity with actual anomaly findings and the questionnaire.","Do not undo a known repair simply because similarity is high if the repaired values are coherent and matchmaking improves.","Focus on remaining contradictions such as impossible rates, reputation state, or differential account tests."},
