        fixes={"Allow Startup to keep Advertise Session ON during HOST phases.","Disable other scripts/hotkeys that toggle the same Cherax feature.","Repeat the diagnostic and confirm no FORCE_SESSION_ON repairs occur after the initial host setup."},
