-- Build 238: native dropdown selection fix + Build 237 Browser polish.
-- • Gives Upcoming Event cards a larger minimum content area so bottom metadata/buttons are never clipped.
-- • Uses four cards only when the viewport can comfortably fit them; otherwise automatically uses three.
-- • Expands the dedicated Browser window closer to the vertical screen edges for extra usable height.
-- • Compacts the Event Details panel slightly so reliability, feedback, and JOIN remain visible without card scrolling.
-- • Preserves Build 234 interactivity, high-resolution icons, Live category/mic columns, and tooltips.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- Build 352: local Active Host discovery for RID Session.
-- • Every encountered non-Startup RID is still logged/enriched locally from Cherax RecentPlayers.
-- • RID Session now intersects that LOCAL RID history with Cherax's own Find Sessions / Found Sessions
--   matchmaking results, so multiple locally-known hosts can be shown as currently discoverable at once.
-- • The current GTA Session Host is always included immediately when non-Startup, even before a Find
--   Sessions refresh completes. Historical users are never called active unless current-session or
--   current Cherax matchmaking evidence exists.
-- • Startup community RIDs remain excluded/purged; Startup users belong in Live Sessions.
-- • No RID Session backend traffic or RID upload. Ping and Mic remain intentionally omitted.
-- • Find Sessions filters are broadened only for the search call when safe, then restored immediately.
-- • If a Cherax Found Sessions label cannot be matched to a locally logged RID/name, it is ignored rather
--   than guessed. Raw result counts/sample labels are retained for diagnostics.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
